{"id":18305,"name":"Van Buren County","slug":"van-buren-county","state":"Michigan","code":"MI","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/van-buren-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:50:44","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$1,000 hold on a credit card as a deposit","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"Held twice each year, in August and October"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Treasurer, Van Buren County, MI"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Tax-Sale.info"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Van Buren Official County Website"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-MIchigan-Video-Place-Holder-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18308 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Van Buren County MIchigan Video Place Holder\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Snap-Up-Properties-for-40-90%-Off-in-Van-Buren-County,-Michigan's-Tax-Sale\">Snap Up Properties for 40-90% Off in Van Buren County, Michigan&#8217;s Tax Sale</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Looking to invest in property at a steep discount? Van Buren County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan</mark></a>, offers tax foreclosure sales that allow you to buy properties for 40% to 90% off market value. Here’s how you can start.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Tax deed investing can yield high returns compared to traditional investments. The entry cost is relatively low, making it an attractive option for those looking to break into real estate.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Understanding-Tax-Deeds\">Understanding Tax Deeds</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>A tax deed grants ownership of a property to a purchaser when the original owner fails to pay their property taxes. In Van Buren County, public auctions sell these properties, with the minimum bid typically covering all back taxes, penalties, and associated costs.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Tax-Deed-Investing-in-Van-Buren-County\">Steps to Start Tax Deed Investing in Van Buren County</h2>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s crucial to understand the legal framework surrounding tax deed sales in Van Buren County. Key regulations include the auction process, bid procedures, and the obligations of winning bidders.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The Van Buren County Treasurer’s Office provides information on upcoming tax sales and auction rules. Check their website regularly for updates: <a href=\"https://www.vanburencountymi.gov/517/Treasurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Treasurer</mark></a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"http://tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan Public Land Auction | Tax-Sale.info</mark></a> is the platform where you can participate in the Van Buren County auctions. Ensure you&#8217;re registered and authorized for bidding: <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Understand Auction Details</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The auction occurs in two stages: advance bidding and active bidding. Advance bidding begins 30 days before the auction, allowing you to place and adjust your bids without seeing others&#8217; bids. Active bidding starts at 10:00 AM on the auction day, allowing you to see current high bids and adjust accordingly.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"5\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>If you have any inquiries, you can contact the Van Buren County Treasurer&#8217;s Office directly at 219 E Paw Paw Street, Suite 302, Paw Paw, MI 49079-1429, or call (800) 259-7470.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Van-Buren-County-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18309 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Van Buren County Courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Thoroughly</strong>: Always research the properties you’re interested in before bidding.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Understand the Costs</strong>: Winning bids include a 10% buyer’s premium, current year’s summer taxes, and a $30 deed recording fee.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Timely Payments</strong>: Winners have five business days to complete the payment and submit notarized paperwork. You can make payments via wire transfer, certified check, or credit/debit card.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.vanburencountymi.gov/522/Tax-Sale-Auction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Tax Sale Auction</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.vanburencountymi.gov/517/Treasurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Treasurer</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How do I register for the Van Buren County tax sale?</strong> <br>A: You can register on <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\">Tax-Sale.info</a> and get authorized by placing a $1,000 hold on your credit card.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if I win a bid?</strong> <br>A: You’ll receive an email with payment instructions and details about submitting the required notarized paperwork.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Can I inspect the properties before bidding?</strong> <br>A: It’s highly recommended that you do your due diligence and inspect the properties where possible, but physical access might be restricted.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Need-a-Hand?\">Need a Hand?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you need further assistance or have questions about tax lien investing, feel free to <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">book a call</mark></a> with us. Happy bidding!</p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}